				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:57:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アクロマ『およしなさい▼
わざわざ　危険なことに
首を　はさむ　必要は　ない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:03:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
