				Time="2011-12-15T11:01:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T06:34:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そこの　洞穴は
古代の抜け道！▼
最近　みつかったんだが
なんと　なんと！▼
あれ？　どこに
つながって　いたんだっけ……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:02:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T06:35:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
